{"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"session/update","params":{"sessionId":"separated-salt","update":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_thought_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"The build claims 26/26 tests passed, but I need to verify this independently. The launch checks look good, with detailed logs confirming success and proper handling of refusals. For time-to-gate, the build reports ~2.3 seconds, which aligns with previous cycles, so I'll use that measured duration. Now I need to spot-check the scenario files to ensure the tests genuinely demonstrate the claimed outcomes."},"_meta":{"cognition.ai/timestamp":"2026-11-23T17:21:00.468778500+00:00"}}}}
