ference:snapshot/\u001b[0mc\u001b[0m\nommit, gate:passed, ui:shell-theme, email:*). Cycle-2 evidence flags all closed: H1 driver bug fixed (scenarios.py:370)\u001b[0m,\u001b[0m\n connectors-F8-verify.json present and real, launch-server.out fresh .003, steward ran autonomously 3x pre-wake, tempor\u001b[0ma\u001b[0m\nl classification correct (2030→future, 2020→historical), focused-need and chat-invocation deepened. Direction-003 recti\u001b[0mf\u001b[0m\nications delivered: G1 blocking playback floor, G2 illustrated bust portraits bound per persona, G3 distinct live regis\u001b[0mt\u001b[0m\ners, G4 port-refusal + exclusive bind + watchdog terminate (all four launch-check legs pass). All six execution-structu\u001b[0mr\u001b[0m\ne conventions conformed on record (FEATURES.md:174-182); prior recorded challenges (C-ConnectorSet, C-DesktopShell part\u001b[0mi\u001b[0m\nal) retained — no silent departures. Flags for owner: (1) S-personality-roster lists 12 entries with each of 6 names du\u001b[0mp\u001b[0m\nlicated — double-seeding in scenario runtime; (2) S-close-terminate scenario file embeds checkFile:null (driver gap, ev\u001b[0mi\u001b[0m\ndence itself passes); (3) floor-played rows carry playbackMs:null despite the devlog claim of the field; heldUntilPlayb\u001b[0ma\u001b[0m\nckComplete is the load-bearing flag and is true; (4) S-competing-tools named leg still 1-of-2 adequate — genuine 2-adeq\u001b[0mu\u001b[0m\nate competition only via set retrievals; (5) instance not serving on :9760 at JEV time — final boot recorded ok at 03:3\u001b[0m4\u001b[0m\n, watchdog likely stopped it post-session; launch evidence stands. time to implement tracked per devlog Cycle-3 entry (\u001b[0ms\u001b[0m\nession ~03:05–03:34, plus prior Part-1 segment). No frontier-model escalation recommended — evidence is genuine run out\u001b[0mp\u001b[0m\nut and unambiguous.\""}}],"_meta":{"cognition.ai/inferenceToolName":"exec","cognition.ai/terminalPreview":true}}}}
