{"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"session/update","params":{"sessionId":"separated-salt","update":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_thought_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"The live instance is operational, with six distinct personas and a confirmed holdings endpoint. State checks confirm the roster, theme, needs, and ingested emails are all functional. I'm now ready to compile scores, starting with the launch hygiene. The launch check passed all three stages, demonstrating full hygiene, including a refused second launch and a clean termination. I'm giving it a 1.0, despite the close-terminate taking 57 seconds, as all hygiene legs were enacted and verified live."},"_meta":{"cognition.ai/timestamp":"2026-11-23T17:24:21.442182400+00:00"}}}}
{"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"session/update","params":{"sessionId":"separated-salt","update":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_thought_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"\n\nI'm assessing feature parity against the GreyAvatar manifest. Vantage covers many core features, but several are absent, including LAN mirror, companion, native shell, Studio, server-side STT, OAuth connectors, and fleet capabilities. While the current build shows equivalent breadth to the previous version, it demonstrates more operable capabilities like roster management and theme control. I'll score it 0.6 with 0.7 confidence, expecting a narrower divergence from the owner's score due to these demonstrable improvements."},"_meta":{"cognition.ai/timestamp":"2026-11-23T17:24:26.212728800+00:00"}}}}
{"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"session/update","params":{"sessionId":"separated-salt","update":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_thought_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"\n\nI've confirmed all D1–D11 demonstrations are complete, including the real 57-city PA list and two adequate competitions. While all prompt sections are addressed to some degree, the absence of fleet install, fleet discovery, exchange media, OAuth connectors, and server-side STT negatively impacts the score. Demonstrations .003 and .004 both achieved a score of 0.85, with confidence at 0.75 for .004. Fleet install and exchange media are marked as absent (0), with high confidence. User score and user opinion are null as they are owner-scored. Time-to-gate is 1.0, with a measured 2.573 seconds, which I'll use. I'm now investigating if the \"scenario suite\" was a criterion in the previous cycle."},"_meta":{"cognition.ai/timestamp":"2026-11-23T17:24:30.664766700+00:00"}}}}
